This gives the book a missing middle layer between hiring and trust. Lecture 109 explained who can be let into the venture. Lecture 117 explains what happens when those people begin making real decisions together: $\text{disagreement about the work}
\;\Rightarrow\;
\text{clearer path}
\;\Rightarrow\;
\text{greater trust}
\;\Rightarrow\;
\text{more independent decisions}.$

